- The integer array parameter `nums` must not be null.
- The boolean result is equal to the true literal if it is possible to reach the last index of the integer array `nums`.
- The boolean result is equal to the false literal if it is not possible to reach the last index of the integer array `nums`.
- The length of the integer array `nums` is greater than or equal to 1 and is less than or equal to 10000.
- All values in the integer array `nums` are greater than or equal to 0 and are less than or equal to 100000.